# YouTube Channel Setup Progress

- [ ] Navigate to 'Customization' (맞춤설정) menu
- [ ] Check/Upload profile logo in 'Branding' (브랜딩) tab
- [ ] Check/Upload banner image in 'Branding' (브랜딩) tab
- [ ] Check Channel Name in 'Basic Info' (기본 정보) tab
- [ ] Check/Set Description in 'Basic Info' (기본 정보) tab
- [ ] Click 'Publish' (게시) button
- [ ] Take screenshot and report findings
